       - This is the heart of the recursion.  It calculates the nth Fibonacci number by:
         - Recursively calling `fibonacci(n - 1)` to get the (n-1)th Fibonacci number.
         - Recursively calling `fibonacci(n - 2)` to get the (n-2)th Fibonacci number.
